  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will ensure that people and communities in Mykolaiv Region are informed and enabled to act safely around unexploded ordinances. This will be done by increasing awareness and understanding of explosive ordnance risks among the population of Mykolaiv Region.</narrative>
  </description>
